      <h1 class="ed-title">How Long Do Treadmill Motors Last?</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Seven to twelve years for a maintained DC motor, and considerably longer for commercial AC. The number is set by heat, and heat is set by friction — which is entirely within your control.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
